; --value: an amount left as it is keeps its cost and is not added to a converted amount of the same
; commodity. The assignment on a gives it the amounts that make it 3 EUR in all (a total, ==*).
P 2026-01-01 EUR 2 X

2026-01-02 total cost
    (a:d)  4 X @@ 9 USD
    a  ==* 3 EUR
    z

2026-01-03 unit cost
    (a:d)  4 X @ 2 USD
    a  ==* 3 EUR
    z

2026-01-04 no cost: the amounts do merge
    (a:d)  4 X
    a  ==* 3 EUR
    z
